OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786513672
OL,3,CSerial sex attacker facing life in
OL,4,Cjail for double murder
OL,6,FA serial sex attacker could spend the
OL,7,Frest of his life behind bars for
OL,8,Fmurdering two women and raping a third
OL,9,Fafter being left free to kill.
OL,11,FJobless Simon Levy, 40, was found
OL,12,Fguilty at the Old Bailey of murdering
OL,13,Fgrandmother Carmenza Valencia-
OL,14,FTrujillo, 53, in March 2025 and mother-
OL,15,Fof-four Sheryl Wilkins, 39, in August
OL,16,Fthat year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786513672
OL,3,CSerial sex attacker facing life in
OL,4,Cjail for double murder
OL,6,FHe suffocated both women in sexually
OL,7,Fmotivated attacks, with Ms Valencia-
OL,8,FTrujillo found in a largely abandoned
OL,9,Fblock of flats on the Aylesbury estate
OL,10,Fin south-east London, and Ms Wilkins
OL,11,Fbehind a car park wall near Tottenham
OL,12,FHigh Road, north London.
OL,14,FThe killings came after he subjected a
OL,15,Fthird woman to a brutal sex attack in
OL,16,FJanuary last year in the same car park
OL,17,Fwhere Ms Wilkins' body was later found.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786513672
OL,3,CSerial sex attacker facing life in
OL,4,Cjail for double murder
OL,6,FThe surviving victim, who suffered a
OL,7,Fbroken collarbone, told police at the
OL,8,Ftime that she had been raped and knew
OL,9,Fwhere her attacker lived, but she was
OL,10,Fnot formally interviewed until after
OL,11,FLevy had killed twice.
OL,13,FThe jury also found Levy guilty of two
OL,14,Fcounts of rape, grievous bodily harm
OL,15,Fwith intent and the non-fatal
OL,16,Fsmothering of the third woman.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
