PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786513672
OL,3,CSerial sex attacker facing life in
OL,4,Cjail for double murder
OL,6,FDuring the murder trial, prosecutor
OL,7,FTom Little KC had said "predatory"
OL,8,FLevy had targeted the three vulnerable
OL,9,Fwomen, all of whom carried out street
OL,10,Fsex work in order to fund drug
OL,11,Faddictions.
OL,13,FOn Wednesday, Levy will return to the
OL,14,FOld Bailey to be sentenced for the
OL,15,Frape and murders by Judge Mark Lucraft
OL,16,FKC.
OL,26,@oD@XOUoD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
