OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786513672
OL,3,CSerial sex attacker facing life in
OL,4,Cjail for double murder
OL,6,FMurder carries an automatic life
OL,7,Fsentence but the number and
OL,8,Fcircumstances of the murders means
OL,9,Fthat he could be handed a whole-life
OL,10,Forder and never be eligible for
OL,11,Frelease on licence.
OL,13,FFollowing the verdicts on Friday, the
OL,14,FMetropolitan Police, British Transport
OL,15,FPolice and Crown Prosecution Service
OL,16,Fadmitted failings in how they dealt
OL,17,Fwith Levy, who was on bail as his
OL,18,Fattacks on women escalated to double
OL,19,Fmurder.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786513672
OL,3,CSerial sex attacker facing life in
OL,4,Cjail for double murder
OL,6,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,7,FConduct (IOPC) said it had served a
OL,8,Fgross misconduct notice on a Met
OL,9,Fpolice constable and a misconduct
OL,10,Fnotice on a detective sergeant.
OL,12,FScotland Yard has also issued a plea
OL,13,Ffor any more survivors of sex attacks
OL,14,Fby Levy to come forward to police.
OL,16,FLevy's prolific sexual offending
OL,17,Fspanned the period between 2018 to
OL,18,F2025.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
