PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786513672
OL,3,CSerial sex attacker facing life in
OL,4,Cjail for double murder
OL,6,FHe was jailed in 2021 for groping two
OL,7,Fwomen in the summer of 2018, one at
OL,8,FNotting Hill Carnival and the other at
OL,9,Fa party in Camden.
OL,11,FEarlier this year, he was convicted of
OL,12,F11 counts of sexual assault in a
OL,13,Fseparate trial at Inner London Crown
OL,14,FCourt.
OL,16,FLevy was arrested by BTP in November
OL,17,F2024 for sexual assaults on the Tube,
OL,18,Fbut delays in organising an
OL,19,Fidentification parade until the
OL,20,Ffollowing April left him free to carry
OL,21,Fout the rape and first murder.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786513672
OL,3,CSerial sex attacker facing life in
OL,4,Cjail for double murder
OL,6,FFollowing Ms Valencia-Trujillo's
OL,7,Fdeath, Levy was released on bail at
OL,8,Ftwo magistrates' court hearings in May
OL,9,Fand June 2025.
OL,11,FThe Crown Prosecution Service admitted
OL,12,Fthat it had not opposed bail at the
OL,13,Ffirst hearing, and the prosecutor had
OL,14,Fnot given the court all the relevant
OL,15,Finformation for consideration at the
OL,16,Fsecond hearing.
OL,18,FThere were another three crown court
OL,19,Fhearings that he failed to attend for
OL,20,Fvarious reasons, yet no arrest warrant
OL,21,Fwas requested.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786513672
OL,3,CSerial sex attacker facing life in
OL,4,Cjail for double murder
OL,6,FLess than two weeks after a hearing on
OL,7,FAugust 11, he murdered Ms Wilkins.
OL,9,FThe murders of Ms Valencia-Trujillo
OL,10,Fand Ms Wilkins over eight months in
OL,11,F2025 were interspersed with sexual
OL,12,Fassaults on six women on the Tube and
OL,13,FOverground.
OL,15,FAs a convicted sex offender, Levy was
OL,16,Fbeing monitored by the probation
OL,17,Fservice and police but repeatedly lied
OL,18,Fto officers who visited him at the
OL,19,Fhome he shared with his mother,
OL,20,Fclaiming he did not go out and watched
OL,21,FYouTube and films instead.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
