PN,30310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786513672
OL,3,CSerial sex attacker facing life in
OL,4,Cjail for double murder
OL,6,FMs Valencia-Trujillo's children
OL,7,Fdescribed her as a "big character" and
OL,8,F"full of life".
OL,10,FShe became a grandmother in 2024 and
OL,11,Fwas said to be a "much-loved" member
OL,12,Fof the community with a love of salsa
OL,13,Fdancing.
OL,15,FMs Wilkins' family said she was a much-
OL,16,Floved woman and was missed every day
OL,17,Fby those who knew her.
OL,26,@oD@TOUoD@bO]pD@AOUpD@NO]sD@ROUsD@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786513672
OL,3,CSerial sex attacker facing life in
OL,4,Cjail for double murder
OL,6,FSpeaking outside the Old Bailey last
OL,7,Fweek, Detective Chief Inspector Neil
OL,8,FJohn, from Scotland Yard, said: "Simon
OL,9,FLevy is a dangerous and predatory
OL,10,Foffender. His crimes were calculated,
OL,11,Fcruel and deeply disturbing.
OL,13,F"Throughout the trial, he has shown
OL,14,Fcomplete disregard for the victims and
OL,15,Fvictim-survivor, despite being fully
OL,16,Faware of the lasting and devastating
OL,17,Fimpact of his actions."
OL,26,@pD@aOUuD@AOUyD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30312
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786513672
OL,3,CSerial sex attacker facing life in
OL,4,Cjail for double murder
OL,6,FDeputy Assistant Commissioner Kevin
OL,7,FSouthworth, from the Met, said:
OL,8,F"There's a collective system failure
OL,9,Fhere, which has left Levy free to go
OL,10,Fon offending in this awful manner and
OL,11,Fleft these victims at risk from his
OL,12,Fprolific offending, and that's
OL,13,Fsomething which ourselves and
OL,14,Fcolleagues across the criminal justice
OL,15,Fsystem will need to reflect on."
OL,26,@pD@AOUwD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
